<i>The rising new star of this island</i>

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:37.080
<i>Everyone's chiming in to just say</i>

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:39.200
<i>Now, get on your feet, dauntlessly</i>

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.500
<i>Once you grab the microphone, naturally</i>

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.330
<i>We're going to go wild, so check it out</i>

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:45.690
<i>For tonight, the very best dinner</i>

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:47.660
<i>Words going beyond even the color of skin</i>

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:51.290
<i>This universal vibration</i>

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:53.070
<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:55.580
<i>You gonna feel so</i>

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:58.780
<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:04.410
<i>Before the time comes
when there's no turning back</i>

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:07.250
<i>Let's turn things in a positive direction</i>

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:13.830
<i>If you don't take action,
you won't get anywhere</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:18.160
<i>Never gonna stop, never gonna stop</i>

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:20.550
<i>The feeling of love is happiness</i>

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:22.540
<i>You were not in pain, you were not in pain</i>

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:24.700
<i>Because we fall in love, there's sadness</i>

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:26.910
<i>Never gonna stop, never gonna stop</i>

00:01:26.910 --> 00:01:29.040
<i>The feeling of love is happiness</i>

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:31.250
<i>You were not in pain, you were not in pain</i>

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:34.910
<i>Because we fall in love, there's sadness</i>

00:01:34.910 --> 00:01:36.950
<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:39.250
<i>You gonna feel so</i>

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:41.250
<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:50.830
Chapter 9 Ryo

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:44.840
Brother...

00:02:57.910 --> 00:02:59.490
Don't cry anymore.

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:09.720
Come with me to the capital.

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:13.000
The capital?

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:17.340
My elder brother's...

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:19.340
His sword, a memento.

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:22.950
There is no reason to waver.

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:26.500
For when you slay the
Wolves of Mibu with this sword,

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:32.520
only then will come an end to these
days of feeling helpless and impatient.

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:38.840
Now, shall we begin, Suzu?

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:51.310
Master?

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:58.130
What is it, Suzu?

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:04.640
I had them make our meal early.

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:07.690
You should be able to
get to Yodo before noon.

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:11.440
Here you are.

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:16.910
You know, we see each other every morning.

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:19.370
The least you could do is be more friendly.

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:23.160
Hey, Tetsu, the demon
Vice Commander's calling for you.

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:25.360
What did you do this time?

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:27.830
I haven't done anything!

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:32.580
Wahoo!

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:34.750
This is some kind of mistake!

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:37.040
Coming through!
Delivery!

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:39.670
Not you too, Mr. Saito?!

00:04:41.950 --> 00:04:45.090
What is it? I haven't done anything.

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:46.830
You'd better not have.

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:48.970
Like hell I'd stand for you
being up to something so often.

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:54.890
Go to Hyogo. The money's in there.

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:03.330
What did you do, Tatsu?! Being
sent to Hyogo with no warning?!

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:07.070
Calm down, Tetsu!
I'll explain it all to you later.

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:11.200
No! Don't leave me here!

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:14.870
All you have to do is go to the
harbor and pick up my package!

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:16.280
Hurry up and get going!

00:05:22.410 --> 00:05:23.760
The harbor?

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:35.540
What the heck? It's just an errand.

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:37.960
You're the one who just started bawling!

00:05:39.450 --> 00:05:40.940
You want some too, Tatsu?

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:42.620
No thanks!

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:47.250
<i>Lord leyasu Tokugawa, Kumbhira,</i>

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:50.570
<i>please let nothing happen
between here and Kobe.</i>

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:52.740
Did you say something?

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:55.080
Eyes ahead when you're walking. Eyes ahead!

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:56.190
Man...

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:14.910
Hold it right there, you
slant-eyed goblin cat!

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:17.160
After all the trouble you put me through,

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:19.100
you're not even going to say hello?!

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:26.190
What? Tetsu... no... suke...

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:28.700
Hold it right there!

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:32.830
Tetsu, where did you go?!

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:34.660
Damn it!

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:36.160
Tetsu!

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:47.380
And I prayed just a moment
ago for nothing to happen...

00:06:47.910 --> 00:06:51.980
Tetsu!!

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:56.720
Tetsu...!

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:02.940
Why are you following me?!

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:06.440
Because you're running away, of course!

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:08.190
Quit following me!

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:10.030
Then stop!

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:20.040
Why does this always happen to me?

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:24.750
Anyway, I'll go as far as Yodo for now.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:30.290
Damn it, I said quit following me!

00:07:30.290 --> 00:07:32.180
And I said, hold up!

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:37.760
I'm lost.

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:40.910
Bastard! Hold it right there!

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:44.670
I said, I'm lost!

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:48.360
I don't have any idea where we are either.

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:56.910
Where the heck are we walking
right now?! The path's disappeared!

00:07:56.910 --> 00:08:00.160
Try asking that tiny brain of yours!

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:11.330
Water?

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:12.340
Hey, wait!

00:08:16.620 --> 00:08:18.310
Hey, you okay?!

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:21.610
Man, that hurt!

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:26.450
Is your foot okay?

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:29.500
Yeah, the cool water feels good.

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:34.620
You know, we keep bumping into each
other in the weirdest ways, don't we?

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:36.660
Where were you headed?

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:38.280
Yodo.

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:43.950
I was going to the river
quay to meet someone.

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:45.000
What about you?

00:08:45.980 --> 00:08:46.730
Hyogo.

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:50.700
My brother and I are going down Yodo River,

00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:53.450
and then getting on a ship from Osaka.

00:08:53.450 --> 00:08:57.750
Man, you're an idiot!
He's probably worried sick about now!

00:08:57.750 --> 00:08:58.890
I know that.

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:03.980
Well, you want to get going?

00:09:04.330 --> 00:09:06.600
You know where we are?!

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:10.540
If we follow the river south,
we'll come out on the Yodo River.

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:15.530
The Katsura River, the Uji River...
All the rivers of Kyoto lead to the Yodo.

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:17.330
Wow...

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:20.450
You didn't even know that?

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:21.490
Not really.

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:24.540
So, how old are you?

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:25.580
I'm fifteen.

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.370
What?! You're kidding, right?!

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:30.330
I thought you were about twelve or so.

00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:32.830
Well, sorry! So I'm short!

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:34.880
No, I'm sorry.

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:37.240
Have some.

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:41.950
I'm fifteen too.

00:09:41.950 --> 00:09:43.060
Really?

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:51.160
There's Katsura River. See?
It's just like I said.

00:09:51.160 --> 00:09:52.770
Awesome...

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:54.940
Come on, let's hurry!

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:55.610
Right!

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:03.120
Here you are, Mr. Vice Commander.

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:08.920
It's lonely when the adorable page
boy isn't around, don't you think?

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:19.430
Come on, Tetsunosuke.
I'm begging you, please show up.

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:21.660
At least, if he'd gotten lost

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:24.870
and found his way safely back to
the Shinsengumi, that'd be something.

00:10:26.410 --> 00:10:28.940
What if he's causing some
weird problem again?

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:33.940
No, knowing him, he's bound
to be in some sort of scrape!

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:38.700
In that case, what am I supposed to do?

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:41.580
I can't face Mr. Hijikata like this.

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:43.500
Seppuku?!

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:44.790
No way...

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:45.950
What'll I do?

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:51.330
Come on, Tetsu!

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:53.080
I walk in front!

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:55.090
What?! That's <i>my </i>place!

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:57.080
I'm number one!

00:10:57.080 --> 00:10:59.080
With those short legs of yours?

00:10:59.080 --> 00:11:03.580
Damn it!
It's the truth.

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:04.680
Hey, no fair!

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:08.620
Running's no fair!

00:11:08.620 --> 00:11:10.000
The faster man wins!

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:12.000
I knew it, I'm number one!

00:11:14.580 --> 00:11:15.320
Tetsu!

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:19.320
Tetsu!

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:20.780
Tatsu...

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:23.200
Tetsu!!

00:11:23.580 --> 00:11:27.410
You idiot! I was worried
to death about you!

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:29.750
You're hurting me, Tatsu.

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:32.210
Sorry.

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:35.750
Not "sorry"! I was about to die!
I was <i>this </i>close to dying!

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:37.450
Oh, thank goodness!

00:11:37.450 --> 00:11:40.250
I really thought I was a
dead man for a while there.

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:41.150
Huh?

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:47.600
Hey! We'll settle it next time, okay?!

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:50.770
Boat's leaving!

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:55.440
I didn't even ask what his name was.

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:29.150
Have some grub! Have some grub to eat!

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:33.500
How 'bout some burdock soup or
rice cakes rolled in sweet bean paste?!

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:39.070
C'mon, have some wine!
Chow down on some rice cakes too!

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:41.580
"Chow down," she said.

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:43.410
We'll take a break here.

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:45.570
Want to get off and get something to eat?

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:52.830
Man, did I eat!

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:56.300
I'm stuffed.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:04.660
♪ Oh, se ken you shii bai! ♪

00:13:04.660 --> 00:13:08.910
♪ Tadonta don ariran! ♪

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:16.100
♪ Wasa hinadori he,
aza tsurai-tsurai dreamin' ♪

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:26.240
♪ Buddah tri in fresta,
saruda peri os hi! ♪

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:34.040
♪ Aza kanpari ra, habu so garan dreamin' ♪

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:38.670
♪ Oh, se ken you shii bai! ♪

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:43.000
♪ Tadon ariari ran wasa hinadori! ♪

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:47.300
Wine

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:47.300
Food

00:13:43.450 --> 00:13:44.750
What was that?

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:47.300
Hey, you!

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:49.510
He skipped the bill!

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:51.200
Skipped the bill!

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:53.270
Hey, Tetsu...

00:13:55.950 --> 00:13:57.190
<i>Not again.</i>

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:29.830
<i>What's up with this guy?</i>

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:57.950
He finally stopped.

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:01.250
Damnation, what persistence.

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:05.450
You can say whatever you want.
There's something I want to ask...

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:14.030
Excuse me, what're you people doing here?

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:20.640
You scoundrels! You're dastards,
takin' a brat hostage!

00:15:22.160 --> 00:15:23.620
What's he saying?

00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:25.830
I guess we may as well grab him.

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:29.650
No, I seriously don't have
anything to do with him! Really!

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:34.700
Now, let's see some cooperation.

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:40.790
Hey, boy!

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:43.790
This hat...

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:48.840
Hang onto it for me for a bit.

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:56.510
Oh, if it's that little one,
he went that way awful fast.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:59.930
Tetsu, where are you?!

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:03.310
I'll scold you for sure this time!

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:05.340
You're getting punished!

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:12.250
Ready? Go!

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:40.040
Nice catch there, little boy.

00:16:41.530 --> 00:16:44.790
Now you and I aren't strangers anymore.

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:48.150
If you guys so much as give him a scratch,

00:16:48.410 --> 00:16:51.400
I'll score a strike right in the
middle of yer forehead next.

00:16:52.410 --> 00:16:53.450
How dare you?!

00:16:54.370 --> 00:16:55.520
Mister!

00:16:56.750 --> 00:16:59.370
Hey, you hurt anywhere?

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:01.750
Who're these guys?

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:05.870
I can think of too many
possibilities, so I've no idea.

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:07.830
Are you a wanted man?

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:11.710
Hey, now. That's awful, I just saved ya.

00:17:27.910 --> 00:17:33.360
It may not look like much,
but pistol bullets can be pretty pricy.

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:37.200
If we're still goin' to
fight, I'll cut my expenses

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:41.030
and go with choppin' you
down with a warrior's soul!

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:47.000
Now... Are you ready?

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:52.190
Here, Mister, your hat.

00:17:53.290 --> 00:17:56.890
They stomped all over it
when they ran away, didn't they?

00:17:59.500 --> 00:18:02.750
The way you got the timin'
right back there was impressive.

00:18:02.750 --> 00:18:04.200
I guess.

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:08.250
It doesn't look like you've got a sword,
but are you a warrior's get?

00:18:08.250 --> 00:18:09.150
It's a secret!

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:15.870
Then it's okay for me to
be a secret person also.

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:20.120
No, I lied! I'll tell
you, so you tell me too!

00:18:20.350 --> 00:18:23.120
Besides, I've got something
I want to ask you.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:29.450
It'd be for your own good
not to know 'bout me.

00:18:34.370 --> 00:18:37.210
He's so cool...

00:18:39.370 --> 00:18:40.760
Tatsu...

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:45.310
You know "sorry" is good enough for
some things, but not for others, right?

00:18:45.910 --> 00:18:47.750
I'm sorry, my dear brother Tatsu!

00:18:47.750 --> 00:18:51.830
I'm telling you, sorry isn't good enough!

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:54.320
Ouch, ouch, that hurts, Tatsu!

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:56.440
Not good enough!
Ouch, that hurts!

00:18:56.700 --> 00:18:59.720
How many times have you gone missing now?!

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:04.280
I won't do it again.

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:06.960
Shut up! We're going now!

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:08.750
Yes, sir.

00:19:21.290 --> 00:19:23.720
Peacemaker...

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:31.790
But really, a coincidence
if I ever saw one.

00:19:31.790 --> 00:19:35.610
In front of yer eyes is the busiest
man under the heavens, ya know.

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:38.410
Busy running away.

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:41.700
That's not called bein' busy.

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:44.620
My work is floatin' right over there.

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:49.830
What you see over there're the
Kankomaru and Kokuryumaru.

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:54.630
On board are lots of young people
like you, doin' combat trainin'.

00:19:55.450 --> 00:19:57.120
It's not just on ships, though.

00:19:57.120 --> 00:20:00.830
Look! You see that buildin' over there?

00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:03.440
That's the navy's trainin' center.

00:20:04.330 --> 00:20:08.850
There're two hundred youths gathered there,
wantin' to wing their way out into the world.

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:10.700
Into the world...

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:12.140
You betcha.

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:16.000
Beyond this ocean're America and England,

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:18.650
and they're far ahead of Japan.

00:20:18.870 --> 00:20:23.570
We don't have time to be fussin' 'bout
exclusionism and heavenly punishment forever.

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:25.320
Wow...

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:30.750
Come on, Tetsunosuke,
let's go back already.

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:34.700
But I still wanna hang around with him...

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:37.840
Nah, I'll be excusin' myself here.

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:40.880
I gotta get back to the trainin' center.

00:20:41.330 --> 00:20:43.090
I wanna hear more.

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:46.790
If ya feel like seein' me again,
come and visit anytime.

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:50.220
Mister! What's your name?!

00:20:50.660 --> 00:20:54.120
Don't worry. I'm sure we'll meet again.

00:20:58.290 --> 00:21:01.290
Hey, your stuff's here!

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:03.570
Oh, sorry about that.

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:17.540
There you go.

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:18.330
Thank you.

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:21.720
<i>This is awfully light. What is it?</i>

00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:25.840
The world...

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:28.260
What's the matter, Tetsu?

00:21:29.750 --> 00:21:32.220
Oh, it's nothing.

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:36.080
Mr. Hijikata's errand was fun, wasn't it?

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:37.370
Yeah!

00:21:37.370 --> 00:21:41.580
What was the Vice Commander's
package?! Hey, let's take a peek!

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:43.660
You idiot! We could be
sentenced to seppuku for that!

